<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="apple-itunes-app" content="app-id=6745029022">
  <title><%= @shame_visible ? "SHAME! - Blackmail.wtf" : "Staying Focused - Blackmail.wtf" %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>📵</text></svg>">
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/WhirlyBirdie-WideBold.otf" as="font" type="font/otf" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/WhirlyBatsVariable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'WhirlyBirdie';
      src: url('/fonts/WhirlyBirdie-WideBold.otf') format('opentype');
      font-weight: bold;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Whirlybats';
      src: url('/fonts/WhirlyBatsVariable.woff2') format('woff2'),
           url('/fonts/WhirlybatsVariable.ttf') format('truetype');
      font-display: swap;
    }
    :root {
      --bm-red: #e5332a;
      --bm-blue: #4f9bc4;
      --bm-cream: #f9fafb;
      --bm-dark: #120f0e;
      --font-display: 'WhirlyBirdie', Georgia, serif;
      --font-body: 'Avenir Next', Avenir, Montserrat, Corbel, 'URW Gothic', source-sans-pro, sans-serif;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background: var(--bm-dark);
      color: var(--bm-cream);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { text-decoration: none; }
    .container {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bm-blue);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    header .logo img { height: 32px; width: auto; }
    .faq-btn {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid var(--bm-blue);
      background: none;
      color: var(--bm-blue);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
    }
    .faq-btn:hover { background: rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.1); }
    main { flex: 1; text-align: center; }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .status-badge.failed { background: var(--bm-red); color: #fff; }
    .status-badge.focused { display: none; }
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    h1.shame-title { color: var(--bm-red); }
    h1.focus-title { color: var(--bm-blue); }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--bm-blue);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .shame-image {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 360px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 4px solid var(--bm-red);
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(229, 51, 42, 0.4);
      display: block;
    }
    .time-ago {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.5);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .blur-box {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 360px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 4px solid rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.4);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .blur-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: -20px;
      filter: blur(30px);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(229,51,42,0.4) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, rgba(79,155,196,0.35) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(255,191,217,0.3) 0%, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 40% 70%, rgba(229,51,42,0.25) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(160deg, #2a1f1e 0%, #1a2a33 50%, #2a1f1e 100%);
      animation: blurShift 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    @keyframes blurShift {
      0% { filter: blur(30px) brightness(0.9); }
      100% { filter: blur(35px) brightness(1.1); }
    }
    .blur-text {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .share-section {
      background: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.3);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .share-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.5);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .share-buttons {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }
    .share-buttons .btn-share { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      border: none;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
    .btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
    .btn svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .btn-share { background: var(--bm-blue); padding: 1rem 1.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .btn-copy {
      background: rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.15);
      color: var(--bm-cream);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-copy:hover { border-color: var(--bm-blue); background: rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.25); }
    .btn-copy.copied { border-color: #22c55e; background: #22c55e; color: #fff; }
    .btn-whatsapp { background: #25d366; }
    .btn-whatsapp:hover { background: #20bd5a; }
    .btn-x { background: #1a1a1a; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
    .btn-x:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
    .cta-card {
      background: var(--bm-cream);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .cta-card p {
      color: var(--bm-dark);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--bm-red);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(229, 51, 42, 0.4);
    }
    footer {
      border-top: 2px solid var(--bm-blue);
      padding: 2rem 0;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .footer-quote {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--bm-blue);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .footer-copy {
      color: rgba(79, 155, 196, 0.5);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    /* FAQ Modal */
    .modal-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      z-index: 50;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1rem;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open {
      display: flex;
    }
    .modal {
      background: var(--bm-dark);
      border: 2px solid var(--bm-blue);
      border-radius: 16px;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 80vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .modal-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: var(--bm-dark);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bm-blue);
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .modal-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      color: var(--bm-blue);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .modal-close {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: var(--bm-cream);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .modal-close:hover { color: var(--bm-blue); }
    .modal-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .modal-body .faq-item { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .modal-body .faq-item h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      color: var(--bm-red);
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .modal-body .faq-item p {
      color: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.8);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <a href="/" class="logo">
        <img src="/images/BLACKMAILShadow.png" alt="BLACKMAIL">
      </a>
      <button class="faq-btn" onclick="openFaqModal()">?</button>
    </header>

    <main>
      <% if @shame_visible %>
        <div><span class="status-badge failed">FAILED</span></div>
        <h1 class="shame-title">THEY COULDN'T<br>RESIST</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">This person failed their focus session.</p>

        <% if @has_image %>
          <img
            src="<%= shame_page_image_path(@user.page_slug) %>"
            alt="Shame Photo"
            class="shame-image"
          >
        <% end %>

        <% if @shame_activated_at %>
          <p class="time-ago">Failed <%= time_ago_in_words(@shame_activated_at) %> ago</p>
        <% end %>

      <% else %>
        <div><span class="status-badge focused">FOCUSED</span></div>
        <h1 class="focus-title">STAYING<br>STRONG</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">This person is keeping their focus. No shame here... yet.</p>

        <div class="blur-box">
          <div class="blur-bg"></div>
          <div class="blur-text">
            <p>📸<br><br>Photo will show here if they pick up their phone</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <div class="share-section">
        <p class="share-label">Share this page</p>
        <div class="share-buttons">
          <button class="btn btn-share" onclick="shareNative()">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.684 13.342C8.886 12.938 9 12.482 9 12c0-.482-.114-.938-.316-1.342m0 2.684a3 3 0 110-2.684m0 2.684l6.632 3.316m-6.632-6l6.632-3.316m0 0a3 3 0 105.367-2.684 3 3 0 00-5.367 2.684zm0 9.316a3 3 0 105.368 2.684 3 3 0 00-5.368-2.684z"></path></svg>
            Share Link
          </button>
          <button class="btn btn-copy" id="copyBtn" onclick="copyLink()">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
            <span id="copyText">Copy Link</span>
          </button>
          <a class="btn btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/?text=<%= CGI.escape("Check if they failed: #{request.original_url}") %>" target="_blank">
            <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
            WhatsApp
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-x" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=<%= CGI.escape("Check if they failed their focus session: #{request.original_url}") %>" target="_blank">
            <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
            X
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-card">
        <p>Get updates on this page</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Get Blackmail</a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p class="footer-quote">"On your deathbed, do you think you will regret not using your phone more?"</p>
      <p class="footer-copy">&copy; 2025 Blackmail.wtf</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- FAQ Modal -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="faqModal">
    <div class="modal">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h2>FAQ</h2>
        <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeFaqModal()">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>What is this page?</h3>
          <p>This is a public shame page for someone using the Blackmail app. When they fail a focus session by picking up their phone, their embarrassing photo appears here.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How does Blackmail work?</h3>
          <p>Users upload an embarrassing photo and set a focus timer. If they pick up their phone before the timer ends, their photo becomes visible on their public shame page.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Why would someone do this?</h3>
          <p>The fear of public embarrassment is a powerful motivator. By sharing this page with friends, users create real accountability to stay focused and off their phones.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can they hide their photo?</h3>
          <p>Yes! Users can hide their shame photo anytime from the app settings. But until they do, it stays visible to anyone with this link.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Is this page public?</h3>
          <p>The page URL is a random code that's impossible to guess. Only people who have been shared the link can see it - there's no public directory.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function openFaqModal() {
      document.getElementById('faqModal').classList.add('open');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    }

    function closeFaqModal() {
      document.getElementById('faqModal').classList.remove('open');
      document.body.style.overflow = '';
    }

    document.getElementById('faqModal').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
      if (e.target === this) closeFaqModal();
    });

    function shareNative() {
      if (navigator.share) {
        navigator.share({
          title: '<%= @shame_visible ? "SHAME! They failed!" : "Are they focused?" %>',
          text: '<%= @shame_visible ? "They couldn\'t resist their phone!" : "Check if they failed their focus session" %>',
          url: window.location.href
        }).catch(console.error);
      } else {
        copyLink();
      }
    }

    function copyLink() {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.href).then(function() {
        var btn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
        var text = document.getElementById('copyText');
        text.textContent = 'Copied!';
        btn.classList.add('copied');
        setTimeout(function() {
          text.textContent = 'Copy Link';
          btn.classList.remove('copied');
        }, 2000);
      });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
